{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233610","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233610","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423361001:1":{"text":"헤리나 부인, 제이미를 데려왔어요.","source_cn":"胡丽诺女士，我们把詹米带回来啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73A9D0D8B173878D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423361002:1":{"text":"제이미는 오늘 정말 착했어요. 저희에게 평민 지역에 관해서 많은 이야기를 들려줬고요.","source_cn":"詹米今天表现很棒呢，给我们讲了很多关于平民区的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14B24D23E26B0A74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423361003:1":{"text":"얘들아. 제이미와 오로나, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님에게 뭐라고 해야 하지?","source_cn":"孩子们，向詹米、欧罗娜、还有<style=stress...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x807BC5C64D570586","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"얘들아. 제이미와 오로나, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님에게 뭐라고 해야 하지?","female":"얘들아. 제이미와 오로나, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님에게 뭐라고 해야 하지?","variant_male_record_index":"171636","variant_female_record_index":"171637","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423361004:1":{"text":"고맙다고 해야 해요!","source_cn":"要说谢谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25F42DB8990946AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423361005:1":{"text":"도와주셔서 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"非常感谢你们的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9BCC2380CB533DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423361006:1":{"text":"고마워요...","source_cn":"感谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FEB91795F66FEE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423361007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저는 아이들을 데리고 왕성으로 돌아가서 쉰 뒤에 다음 일정을 진행하려고 해요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD898E6D9B5A7989E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저는 아이들을 데리고 왕성으로 돌아가서 쉰 뒤에 다음 일정을 진행하려고 해요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저는 아이들을 데리고 왕성으로 돌아가서 쉰 뒤에 다음 일정을 진행하려고 해요.","variant_male_record_index":"171642","variant_female_record_index":"171643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423361008:1":{"text":"작별 인사 시간인가요?","source_cn":"要告别了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB676070478B1B888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423361009:1":{"text":"아쉽지만 분명 다시 만날 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"虽然不舍，但我相信我们会再见的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC2E0A3A3C8A3EAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423361010:1":{"text":"잘 가요, 프라벨!","source_cn":"再见，芙拉贝尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5CC366E071AF07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423361011:1":{"text":"다음에 또 만나요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 치피, 그리고 해미. 물론 오로나도요! 스스로를 믿으세요!","source_cn":"再见，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F86877C5BD5F36A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다음에 또 만나요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 치피, 그리고 해미. 물론 오로나도요! 스스로를 믿으세요!","female":"다음에 또 만나요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 치피, 그리고 해미. 물론 오로나도요! 스스로를 믿으세요!","variant_male_record_index":"171647","variant_female_record_index":"171648","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:1423361012:1":{"text":"작별 인사를 한 뒤, 프라벨은 플로라와 함께 떠났다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF63DFBC99DCDED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1423361013:1":{"text":"저 누나, 학생들이랑 같이 가버렸어요... 오로나 누나도 이제 갈 시간이에요?","source_cn":"那位大姐姐和她的学生走了……欧罗娜姐姐，你也要走吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x864D33708B024976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1423361014:1":{"text":"...사실 저요, 저 플로라들이 정말 부러웠어요. 쟤들은 선생님이 있잖아요...","source_cn":"……其实、其实我很羡慕那几个花灵，她们有那位大姐姐当老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8986C4841542BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1423361015:1":{"text":"오로나 누나가 준 책은 정말 좋아하는데요, 제가... 글씨를 못 읽어요. 그래서 그림만 보고 무슨 내용인지 추측할 수밖에 없었어요...","source_cn":"欧罗娜姐姐，你送给我的书我很喜欢，但是……我不认识字，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EEA4C065E8FFC5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1423361016:1":{"text":"누나가 저희 선생님 해주면 안 돼요? 제 친구들도 선생님이 필요해요...","source_cn":"你不可以当我的老师吗？还有我的朋友们，如果有老师愿意教...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96359B97B1B9C3AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423361017:1":{"text":"제이미, 사실... 그러고 싶어요! 여러분의 선생님이 되고 싶어요!","source_cn":"詹米，其实……我愿意！我愿意当你们的老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45A49EA04D8957B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1423361017":{"text":"제이미, 사실... 그러고 싶어요! 여러분의 선생님이 되고 싶어요!","source_cn":"詹米，其实……我愿意！我愿意当你们的老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45A49EA04D8957B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1423361018:1":{"text":"멀린 님, 치피, 해미. 제가 정말로 하고 싶은 일을 찾을 수 있도록 그동안 함께 해줘서 정말 고마워요.","source_cn":"梅林大人，满满，漫漫，谢谢你们这段时间陪我，让我找到了...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x00EFEC22EDBB27BB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님, 치피, 해미. 제가 정말로 하고 싶은 일을 찾을 수 있도록 그동안 함께 해줘서 정말 고마워요.","female":"멀린 님, 치피, 해미. 제가 정말로 하고 싶은 일을 찾을 수 있도록 그동안 함께 해줘서 정말 고마워요.","variant_male_record_index":"171655","variant_female_record_index":"171656","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1423361019:1":{"text":"이 아이들은 제가 여기 남아주길 바라고 있어요. 그리고... 저에게도 이 아이들이 필요해요.","source_cn":"这里的孩子需要我留在这里，我觉得，我也需要他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE55F8FFCF2B01EC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1423361020:1":{"text":"좋은 선생님이 되는 방법은 아직 잘 모르지만, 첫걸음을 내딛어 보려고 해요. 아이들이 필요한 것과 원하는 것을 분명히 알려주겠죠...","source_cn":"虽然对于如何做一个老师我还有很多事情不了解，但我愿意踏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7E76A85A1C953B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1423361021:1":{"text":"전 꼭 훌륭한 선생님이 되어서 이 아이들이 누군가의 도움을 받고 스스로의 삶을 선택하는 첫걸음을 떼게 해주고 싶어요.","source_cn":"我一定会做一个好老师，让这些孩子们感觉到，有人愿意帮助...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04AAA1AC2F5E2FD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1423361022:1":{"text":"와! 오로나 누나가 우리 선생님이래! 친구들에게 알려주러 갈게요!","source_cn":"耶！欧罗娜要当我的老师了！我要去告诉朋友们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F27115FA4B742D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1423361023:1":{"text":"제이미, 잠깐... 휴, 저도 친구들을 찾으러 같이 가야겠네요!","source_cn":"詹米，等等……算了，我跟你一起去找他们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9E2066BE23336A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"오로나, 자신감이 생겼네","source_cn":"欧罗娜变得自信起来了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5E204E493AD5491","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오로나, 자신감이 생겼네","female":"오로나, 자신감이 생겼네","variant_male_record_index":"74398","variant_female_record_index":"74399","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:芙拉贝尔":{"text":"프라벨","source":"芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:勇敢的花灵":{"text":"용감한 플로라","source":"勇敢的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冷静的花灵":{"text":"냉정한 플로라","source":"冷静的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的花灵":{"text":"겁먹은 플로라","source":"胆怯的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":9}}